      "note": "The drain engine, assembled. Manabase fixed (black on curve 0.667 -> 0.785), real ramp including Urza's Saga fetched by the commander, one-sided graveyard hate, and two Shrines that drain and gain into three lifegain payoffs. MINOR: the deck does something new — a drain clock that scales — without changing what it is."
